okens to buy your salvation… if you’re still alive by then.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Spider Arena</u></strong> -  A local competitive game for up to 4 players where spiders armed with cannons battle in vertical arenas. Crawl across walls, cling to the ceiling, aim and fire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "A cursed collection of 10 retro horror games, each with its own genre and style, from FPS and platformers to turn-based RPGs and arena combat. Play solo or with friends as you uncover the secrets of a forgotten ROM corrupted by time... and something worse.",
